    <activityDescription>
      <activity id="9d0bbd2d-3d25-5fe5-8d16-4af325b3e122" activityNameId="ab7e64e8-72cc-5907-969f-64485d373d8d" activityNameContextId="f44c43c1-5cc5-54a6-ade6-24435bd12c83" type="1" specialActivityType="0" energyValues="0">
        <activityName xml:lang="en">Printed wiring board, 4 layers, at plant</activityName>
        <generalComment>
          <text xml:lang="en" index="1">Full activity name: Printed wiring board, 4 layers, at plant
This data set describes the fabrication of a multilayer-printed wiring board. It is based on an environmental report and on confidential data from a company.;
UUID: 6aa908f6-a3d4-349b-9015-22ffcdf3c3f6
This data set describes the fabrication of a multilayer-printed wiring board from epoxy resin laminate with the processes of cleaning, laminating with photoresist, etching, pressing to mulitlayer and piercing. It includes energy and water consumption, material and chemicals inputs, transports, waste disposal, infrastructure use as well as emissions into air and water.
Location: &lt;null&gt;
Technology: Fabrication of multilayer printed wiring board
Time period: Period of environmental report and of company data.
Production volume: 915809 m2 1-layer
Sampling: unknown 
Extrapolations: Data for average layer is multiplicated by 4. Data for outer layers multiplied by 2, for inner layers multiplied by 2.
Uncertainty adjustments: none
BAFU mapped export: unsupported biosphere exchanges excluded; see audit/. Local UUIDs and generic activity classification are export conventions. Source: process_6aa908f6-a3d4-349b-9015-22ffcdf3c3f6.xml</text>
        </generalComment>
      </activity>
